# s89-across.pad — S89: straight across free06's railway bed, from s89-rails.toml's "across" state
# (47 ft short of the z≈4607 straight, facing +z).
#
# Wall-clock at a quarter speed, so every game second is 4000 ms here: half a second idle, four on
# the gas (cross), which carries the bike up the bed's shoulder, over its top and down the far side,
# a second and a half on the brake (square), and the pad let go.
#
#   ./kit record watch/s89-rails.toml --state 9 --pad watch/pads/s89-across.pad -n 300
sleep 2000
down cross
sleep 16000
up cross
down square
sleep 6000
release
